  "steps": [
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_f5a8c9c360a21523",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "水潭边，阳光正好。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "绯恩在水潭边上坐了一上午了。这个时候大部分人在工作，所以没人来这边找她。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "fein_story",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她什么也没说，只是有一搭没一搭地用手指撩拨着水花。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "乐声遥遥地传来。明明已经知道是怎么回事了，但女孩反而更心乱如麻。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "但没有时间让绯恩继续发愣了。出现在面前的是——",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_8cea0b0e87ad5f1d",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": -0.2,
        "offset_y": 0.24,
        "scale": 1.23
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "哇哈！对上了视线！爱心鱼使用水炮！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "艾欣愉小姐，你怎么在这……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "害！鱼出现在水里难道不是很合理吗？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_dba6cf1c68bdcb39",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "自从安装了“太晶斗”栅栏之后，古剑喵就再也不敢偷鱼了。她可害怕那些拳头了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_f5a8c9c360a21523",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "fein_story",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "啊这……没想到那种看着很玄学的东西真的有用……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "那是。要不然为什么每次我抡出去的椅子总能准确的砸到路过的麻咪呢？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "其实艾欣愉每次都想砸古剑喵，但是古剑喵太灵活了，所以都是麻咪在遭殃。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "但好在，那些栅栏虽然让古剑喵退避三舍，但对麻咪毫无影响。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "绯恩小姐在这里干嘛。难道是在摸鱼？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "我警告你嗷，你要是被我培养的粗糙皮肤爱心鱼蹭伤了手，可别怪我没提醒你。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "感谢提醒……虽然我并不是在这里摸鱼啦……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "那是怎么回事？这欲言又止的样子，我至少在十个人脸上看到过。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "要我说，想说什么就大大方方去说。说对了就成了，没说对就说你在假。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "反正那群人天天假来假去，也不差你一个了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "噗。还真是别开生面的引导呢。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "绯——恩——小——姐——！！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "啊哈，有人来找你了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_468eaa830ec69bd2",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": 0.19,
        "offset_y": 0.19,
        "scale": 1.23
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "你是什么鱼，吃我水炮！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "害搁这水炮呢，古剑喵戴了一个幽灵小鬼头环，翻过了你的太晶斗栅栏。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_55e5702a5eff6d5c",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": -0.2,
        "offset_y": 0.24,
        "scale": 1.23
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "艾欣愉",
      "text": "什么，我的鱼啊，溜！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "艾欣愉飞一样地跑掉了，仿佛触发了悠游自如。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "fein_story",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_468eaa830ec69bd2",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "古语俞小姐？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "订单做完了。请绯恩小姐有空的时候去一趟工坊。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "衣服做完了，总得现场试试。若是不合身，还可以改。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "回到工坊的时候，工坊已经没人了。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_c436166693d1ad1d",
      "duration": 0.45,
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "background"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "fein_story",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_468eaa830ec69bd2",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "right",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "！！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "怎样？姐姐我的手笔。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": false
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_151e191b7282748b",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "slide",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "嗯……凉飕飕的……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "对啦，那个人现在应该在港口那边呢。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "诶？？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "我说——你们俩昨天出双入对腻歪在一块，真以为咱都是电灯泡啊！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "诶！！！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_72669f1daee94a65",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": 0.16,
        "offset_y": 0.05,
        "scale": 0.96
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "这……这这这……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "算啦~不调侃你。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "不过有件事需要顺道拜托绯恩小姐一下。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_151e191b7282748b",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": null,
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "slide",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "什么事？",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "萤火草、夜铃花。最近的工单上出现了这些材料。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "我去商店问过，没有这些物产出售，所以想请绯恩小姐帮忙，找到合适的时候采集一些。",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "没问题！我下午就去！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "倒也不用这么急。你真的不去给那一位看一下嘛~",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "asset_id": "summer_72669f1daee94a65",
      "breakthrough": 0,
      "duration": 0.28,
      "flip": false,
      "layout": {
        "offset_x": 0.16,
        "offset_y": 0.05,
        "scale": 0.96
      },
      "partner_id": "",
      "slot": "left",
      "transition": "fade",
      "type": "portrait",
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "绯恩",
      "text": "古语俞小姐不要再说奇怪的话了！",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "focus": "none",
      "speaker": "古语俞",
      "text": "呵呵……",
      "type": "dialogue"
    },
